# Adjourn web — FalkorDB Cloud connection.
#
# Copy to .env.local for local development, or set these in the Vercel project's
# Environment Variables. Never commit a filled-in copy: .env* is gitignored
# except for this example file.
#
# With FALKORDB_CLOUD_HOST unset, the app runs from web/demo-snapshot.json and
# shows a "demo data" tag in the footer. That is the intended state until the
# cloud instance is provisioned.

FALKORDB_CLOUD_HOST=
FALKORDB_CLOUD_PORT=6379
FALKORDB_CLOUD_USERNAME=
FALKORDB_CLOUD_PASSWORD=
FALKORDB_GRAPH=adjourn
